      "snippet": {
        "line": 67,
        "text": "def powerH F XR X := Real.sqrt (2 * X) * powerE F XR X, powerE F XR X = F.powerE (X/XR) = powerConstant F.data * (X/XR) ^ (-(1/2 + F.data.h)) — the paper's H_pow = √(2X) c_∞ X^{−A} with A = 1/2 + h"
